 seat surface, padded seat/back/armrests, folding side table and built-in cup holder.\"},{\"id\":\"C1-L24\",\"quote\":\"600D Oxford seat material on a steel-tube frame.\"},{\"id\":\"S2-T5-R0\",\"quote\":\"Seat material: 600D Oxford\\nFrame: Steel tube\"}]},{\"id\":\"claims_c07_c08\",\"score\":1,\"reason\":\"C07正确描述一个双人连续座面及其单框架配件；C08的扶手、杯托、框架、背包、材质及载荷均受对应资料支持，没有额外推广性性能断言。\",\"evidence\":[{\"id\":\"C1-L27\",\"quote\":\"Includes one frame, one double seat cover, one carry bag and two compression straps.\"},{\"id\":\"S2-P31\",\"quote\":\"A continuous double seat for two people; detachable padded seat cover; one folding frame, carry bag and two compression straps.\"},{\"id\":\"C1-L29\",\"quote\":\"adjustable armrests, mesh cup holder, steel frame and shoulder carry bag\"},{\"id\":\"S2-P35\",\"quote\":\"Adjustable armrests, mesh cup holder, steel frame and shoulder carry bag.\"},{\"id\":\"C1-L29\",\"quote\":\"Maximum static load: 120 kg (265 lb) per chair; maximum impact load: 100 kg (220 lb) per chair.\"},{\"id\":\"S2-T7-R0\",\"quote\":\"Maximum static load: 120 kg / 265 lb\\nMaximum impact load: 100 kg / 220 lb\"}]},{\"id\":\"claims_c09_c10\",\"score\":1,\"reason\":\"C09和C10采用的靠背、填充、折叠框架、收纳部件、躺位及随附部件均来自各自产品资料；没有采用未支持的持续舒适、速度或专门用途承诺。\",\"evidence\":[{\"id\":\"C1-L31\",\"quote\":\"padded seat and back, cup holder, side pocket and quick folding frame\"},{\"id\":\"S2-P40\",\"quote\":\"Reclined mesh back; padded seat and back; cup holder, side pocket and quick folding frame.\"},{\"id\":\"C1-L33\",\"quote\":\"three seating positions including lay-flat, foam pillow, mesh back, storage pouch and rear towel bar\"},{\"id\":\"S2-P44\",\"quote\":\"Three seating positions including lay-flat; foam pillow, mesh back, storage pouch and rear towel bar.\"},{\"id\":\"C1-L33\",\"quote\":\"600D Oxford seat material with an aluminum-alloy frame.\"},{\"id\":\"S2-T9-R0\",\"quote\":\"Seat material: 600D Oxford\\nFrame: Aluminum alloy\"}]},{\"id\":\"measurement_item_scope\",\"score\":1,\"reason